{"version":1,"key":"quest:191","content":{"id":191,"title":"Math.hypot 的作用？","summary":"暂未记录答案","target":{"key":"quest:191","type":"quest","id":191},"groupId":2,"groupTitle":"前端","groupColor":"mint-green","status":"resolved","answers":[],"materials":[{"index":1,"kind":"card","group":"note","title":"Math.hypot 避免距离计算的溢出与下溢","meta":"","excerpt":"在计算两点距离或向量模长时，手动用 Math.sqrt 写平方和容易遇到数值溢出的问题，Math.hypot 就是为此而生的，它计算所有参数平方和的平方根。 Math.hypot(value1, value2, /* …, */ valueN) 最常见的用途是计算二维、三维空间的距离，或者向量的模。 // 二维两个点的","target":{"key":"card:752","type":"card","id":752},"citeKey":"card:752"}],"trail":[{"time":1780483012426,"tone":"start","text":"提出问题","refs":[]},{"time":1780617927317,"tone":"milestone","text":"写下卡片","refs":[1]},{"time":1780618888224,"tone":"done","text":"标为已解决","refs":[]}],"description":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"createTime":1780483012426,"updateTime":1780483012426,"resolvedTime":1780618888224},"meta":{"type":"quest","publishTime":1780483012426}}